    dPhi:    -rho_b(x) - rho_d(x) + Derivative(u(x), (x, 2))/(4*pi*G) = 0
    dlambda: -4*pi*G*rho_d(x) + Derivative(v(x), (x, 2)) = 0
    (u - v)'' - 4 pi G w rho_b  = 4 pi G dPhi - dlambda          residual: 0
    Phi'' - u'' - [Q'(u-v)']'   = 4 pi G du   (deep-MOND Q)      residual: 0
    4 pi G lambda'' + [Q'(u-v)']' = 4 pi G dv                    residual: 0
    potential felt by baryons: Phi_ph(x) + u(x)  (w = 0: Phi_ph(x) + u(x);  w = 1: Phi_ph(x) + u(x));  by the dark component: u(x)
